### Security fixes

* Updated the Go build toolchain to 1.26.10 and distroless runtime images to include the compromised certificate authority mitigations ([#5891](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5891)).
* Updated `github.com/getkin/kin-openapi` to v0.149.0 to address validation bypass and denial-of-service vulnerabilities ([#5832](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5832)).
* Updated UI Vite to v8.3.4 to address dependency vulnerabilities ([#5802](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5802)).

### Bug fixes

* Fixed decoding of resource and scope attributes stored in the OpenTelemetry profiles dictionary ([#5894](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5894)).

### Documentation

* Documented Windows support for .NET Framework 4.7, 4.8, and IIS ([#5869](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5869)).

## Changelog
