* 7aac40dca9cbb36f249b25a2c00bc172ca96be67 docs(dotnet): mark .NET Framework 4.7, 4.8 and IIS as supported on Windows (#5868) (#5869)
* 36d558a4799e86ce9814a5348e6ecc300e4ed192 docs: prepare v2.4.1 security release notes (#5898)
* 7c8fa46c667dfb930c817a65f3ec198bca624328 fix(security/high/): update module github.com/getkin/kin-openapi to v0.149.0 [security] (#5832)
* 81eb9c5ad8e398bdcacc82cb17a9b3587ced566b fix: resource and scope attributes encoded through the profiles dictionary (#5857) (#5894)

